# Commerce

- `/shop` is Shopify KWW merch (client-side cart, localStorage). `/gear-guide` is Amazon Associates. Do not mix catalogs, CTAs, or tracking.
- Affiliate disclosure stays on `/affiliate-disclosure` and on Amazon surfaces — not on KWW merch PDPs as if they were affiliate.
- Original-IP only. No school, restaurant, or third-party branding on merch. Waco landmarks (ALICO, bridges, skyline) must be visibly accurate; use owner-approved skyline art only (`docs/KWW_MERCH_VIBE_SPEC.md`).
- merch-launch defaults to `DRY_RUN=true`. Do not set `DRY_RUN=false`, `--create-drafts`, or `--publish` without explicit approval.
- Shopify/Printify Phase 2 is closed. Do not run `scripts/shopify/**` or `scripts/printify/**` write paths without a separately approved scope.
- Never delete or overwrite existing Shopify/Etsy products. Detect duplicate handles before create.
- Cart and shop UI work without backend secrets. Do not require Supabase for `/shop`.
